  "findings": [
    "Rebuilt by the batch-D LilScript compiler (a430d5df, finer/059-idiom-directed-naming: data tables as a codec-judged choice).",
    "Source: the font-metrics table is LilScript data (src/data.lil, an object literal) and `version` a LilScript export; scripts/build.mjs no longer stitches the upstream data module or a version export onto the compiled module. src/fontMetricsData.js stays as the audit reference.",
    "The compiler chose, under Brotli, columns of x1e5 integers with delta-coded keys for the metrics table.",
    "katex.cjs, katex.umd.js, katex.min.js and the contrib .cjs/.min.js files are esbuild re-bundles of the compiler ESM, not compiler-written (plan M12.2).",
